---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
export const prerender = true;
---
<BaseLayout title="Product">
  <h1>Product</h1>
  <p>This page describes the product the company is imagined to sell. The customer workspace is <strong>planned</strong>: it counts as existing only once it is built and tested.</p>
  <h2>Private workspaces</h2>
  <p>Each customer gets a workspace that only its own users can open.</p>
  <h2>Uploads</h2>
  <p>Customers upload files in the workspace, or send data automatically with an API key.</p>
  <h2>Questions and reports</h2>
  <p>Users query their own data and share reports with colleagues in the same workspace.</p>
</BaseLayout>
